@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor white
skinparam PackageBorderColor black
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam minClassWidth 220
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 80
hide circle
hide empty members
package "基础采购及负责人确认" as O {
' @reference material
class "材料" as material_o <<entity>>
class "供应商" as supplier <<entity>> {
 名称、联系人、电话、地址
 启用状态
 --
 +核对供方及联系资料()
}
class "采购" as purchase_order <<entity>> {
 需求依据、交付约定
 待确认／已确认／已取消
 提出及确认人、时间、取消原因
 --
 +核对供应商及采购明细()
 +提交采购需求()
 +确认采购(负责人)
 +取消采购(原因)
}
class "采购项目" as purchase_order_item <<entity>> {
 材料、正的采购数量
 单位、换算、精度、单价快照
 --
 +核对采购量及计量()
 +固定确认时约定快照()
 +核对累计合格支持量()
}
supplier "1" -- "0..*" purchase_order
purchase_order "1" *-- "0..*" purchase_order_item
material_o "1" -- "0..*" purchase_order_item
supplier -[hidden]right- material_o
note bottom of purchase_order_item
助理提出，负责人确认；未确认不作验收依据。
采购确认不代表到货、入库或实际付款。
取消与超供协调保留依据，不删除原到货事实。
end note
}
@enduml
